15:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"The site sets no cookies and runs no analytics, ad pixels or cross-site tracking, which is why there's no cookie banner. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control signals don't change anything here because there's no tracking for them to switch off."}]
