19:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"Messages from the Work with me form stay in my inbox while we're talking. If we work together, I keep them as long as the work and my tax records need them. Anything else, ask and I'll delete it."}]
